# ============================================================
# NeoMundi AI Weather -- PRIVATE LOCAL RUNNER
# ============================================================
# Entire local measurement runner:
# provider keys, internal model IDs, raw responses,
# scored observations and publication staging.
#
# This directory MUST NEVER be committed to the public repo.
/AI_WEATHER_RUNNER/
# Extra safety in case secret files are accidentally moved
# outside AI_WEATHER_RUNNER.
secrets.weather.xml
**/secrets.weather.xml
# Raw / scored local measurement data
**/raw/
**/scored/
# Local runner outputs / staging
**/AI_WEATHER_RUNNER/output/
# PowerShell temporary / debug files
*.ps1.bak
*.ps1.tmp
